      "start": 1500,
      "details": "<p class=\"p1\"><em>Cebel-i \u1e6c\u0101r\u0131\u1e33</em>:\u00a0However, the author of <em>Ev\u017ca\u1e25u\u2019l-mes\u0101lik</em> writes that <em>Cebel-i \u1e6c\u0101r\u0131\u1e33</em> (modern <em data-start=\"177\" data-end=\"188\">Gibraltar</em>) is near <em>End\u00fcl\u00fcs</em> (al-Andalus). When the Muslims came for the conquest of al-Andalus and sought inhabit there, it was called <em>Cebel-i Fet\u1e25</em> (\u201cMountain of the Conquest\u201d). [translation]</p>",
